# LYNE Protocol — authors

Author and original designer of the LYNE Protocol family (LP 0.1, the LP 0.2 candidates and every later version):

Margus Šuman
Estonia

Affiliation: Nocta OÜ (Estonia), which operates the LYNE project.

Protocol Steward: Margus Šuman (GOVERNANCE.md).

No other person is an author of the protocol. Contributors to a specific version, if any, are credited in that
version's CHANGELOG entry; accepting contributions never changes the originator or the historical authorship above.
Software tools used while writing the specifications, tests or this package (including AI assistants) are tools, not
authors.
